{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/pulls/2380","id":2298727495,"node_id":"PR_kwDOEFLz886JA8xH","html_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2380","diff_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2380.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/juanfont/headscale/pull/2380.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juanfont/headscale/issues/2380","number":2380,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Spell check and updating docs","user":{"login":"nbelles","id":36868971,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM2ODY4OTcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/36868971?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles","html_url":"https://github.com/nbelles","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/nbelles/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nHeadscale is \"Open Source, acknowledged contribution\", this means that any\r\ncontribution will have to be discussed with the Maintainers before being submitted.\r\n\r\nThis model has been chosen to reduce the risk of burnout by limiting the\r\nmaintenance overhead of reviewing and validating third-party code.\r\n\r\nHeadscale is open to code contributions for bug fixes without discussion.\r\n\r\nIf you find mistakes in the documentation, please submit a fix to the documentation.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n<!-- Please tick if the following things apply. You… -->\r\n\r\n- [ ] have read the [CONTRIBUTING.md](./CONTRIBUTING.md) file\r\n- [ ] raised a GitHub issue or discussed it on the projects chat beforehand\r\n- [ ] added unit tests\r\n- [~] added integration tests\r\n- [X] updated documentation if needed\r\n- [X] updated CHANGELOG.md\r\n\r\n<!-- If applicable, please reference the issue using `Fixes #XXX` and add tests to cover your new code. -->\r\n\r\nI noticed a slight inconsistency in the public docs (the `/windows` and `/apple` pages were referenced but not `/android`) and I figured while I was making this PR that I might as well do a quick spell check across the codebase. Most everything was updating spelling in comments. \r\n\r\nThere is one actual code change in an integration test (`/integration/cli_test.go`) that had a string that had a typo in it. That is probably the only thing that could use a pair of eyes from an actual codebase developer to make sure that doesn't break anything. \r\n\r\nThanks!","created_at":"2025-01-26T17:28:22Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T15:35:42Z","closed_at":"2025-02-05T15:35:42Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[{"login":"kradalby","id":98431,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk4NDMx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98431?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby","html_url":"https://github.com/kradalby","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kradalby/received_events","type":"